    "title": "'Euphoria' Season 3 Episode 1 – release date, schedule, how to watch",
    "text": "\"Euphoria\" Season 3 is set for release on April 12 on HBO and HBO Max, and will likely conclude the series, which began in the summer of 2019.With a star-studded cast, now frequently occupied by big-budget Hollywood productions, Season 3 will reunite Zendaya, Hunter Schafer, Eric Dane, Jacob Elordi, Sydney Sweeney, Alexa Demie, Maude Apatow, Martha Kelly, Chloe Cherry, Adewale Akinnuoye-Agbaje, and Toby Wallace for the anticipated final chapter.It's been more than four years since the cast was seen on screen together, and this season will explore \"the virtue of faith, the possibility of redemption, and the problem of evil,\" as per HBO, which announced the Season 3 logline along with the trailer release.Season 3 will be eight episodes long, releasing weekly on Sunday nights at 9 p.m. ET/PT on HBO and HBO Max.Sydney Sweeney in HBO's \"Euphoria\" Season 3. | Photograph by Patrick Wymore/HBO'Euphoria' Season 3 Episode 1 Release Date\"Euphoria\" Season 3 Episode 1 will be available on HBO and HBO Max on April 12, 2026.Watch: Euphoria Season 3'Euphoria' Season 3 Episode 1 – How to Watch\"Euphoria\" Season 3 Episode 1 will be available on HBO and HBO Max from 9 p.m. ET/PT on April 12.To watch \"Euphoria,\" a subscription to HBO Max is required. A basic subscription with ads is $10.99 per month or $109.99 for the year, and a standard no-ads subscription starts at $18.99 per month or $184.99 annually.What Time Does 'Euphoria' Season 3 Episode 1 Come Out?\"Euphoria\" Season 3 Episode 1 will be available to watch on HBO and HBO Max from 9 p.m. ET/PT on April 12.With the evening streaming release, it will debut in other countries at different times. Here is when new episodes of \"Euphoria\" Season 3 will be out in different time zones:April 12BRT: 10:00 p.m. April 13BST: 2:00 a.m. CEST: 3:00 a.m. IST: 6:30 a.m.JST: 10:00 a.m.AET: 11:00 a.m.NZDT: 1:00 p.m.'Euphoria' Season 3 Release ScheduleEpisode 1: April 12Episode 2: April 19Episode 3: April 26 Episode 4: May 3Episode 5: May 10Episode 6: May 17 Episode 7: May 24Episode 8: May 31'Euphoria' Season 3 Episode 1 RuntimeIn previous seasons, episodes of \"Euphoria\" were typically one hour long. What Will Happen in 'Euphoria' Season 3 Episode 1?The official synopsis for Episode 1 of \"Euphoria\" Season 3 is not currently available. However, HBO has released an official logline for the season: \"A group of childhood friends wrestle with the virtue of faith, the possibility of redemption, and the problem of evil.\"Will There Be a Season 4 of 'Euphoria'?It is believed that Season 3 of \"Euphoria\" will be the final season.",
